nversion updating only the special token embedding</figcaption></div></figu=
re>
<p>After finetuning, the model generates images of the new subject when pro=
mpted with the special token.</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
;"><img alt=3D"Image represents a text-to-image generation system using a d=
