<h5 id=3D"lora-for-t2i-personalization">LoRA for T2I personalization</h5>
<p>To apply LoRA to our pretrained T2I model, we inject trainable parameter=
s into the diffusion model and update only those parameters during finetuni=
ng to learn the new identity. This method requires training of only a fract=
ion of the model's parameters, which is much faster and more memory-efficie=
nt.</p>
