esenting feature vectors. A double-headed arrow connects these feature vect=
ors, labeled 'Similarity,' indicating a comparison process that calculates =
the similarity between the feature vectors of the generated and real images=
.  The overall system aims to quantify the similarity between a generated i=
mage and a real image based on a textual description, using the CLIP model =
to embed both images and text into a common feature space." loading=3D"lazy=
" width=3D"408" height=3D"344" decoding=3D"async" data-nimg=3D"1" src=3D"ht=
tps://bytebytego.com/images/courses/genai-system-design-interview/personali=
